    {
      "id": "chase-travel-redesign",
      "title": "Chase Travel Redesign",
      "description": [
        "Chase Travel's homepage was built for exploration, but most visitors arrived with a destination already in mind, exploring in Expedia, Google Flights, etc. Most of the page was discovery content — yet it drove under 0.01% engagement, and 90% of customers said in testing they didn't want it."
      ],
      "description2": [
        "Working with product and marketing, I redesigned the homepage around value: a hero leading with rewards and redemption, personalized to each customer's card. The redesign also showed the full breadth of what Chase offered — connecting every offering back to the card rewards at the center of Chase Travel's value prop."
      ],
