    {
      "id": "column",
      "title": "Guided Multi-Product Activation",
      "description": [
        "97% of new Chase SMB customers arrived through migration from consumer banking — users sign in to a new interface overnight, unaware of certain SMB-specific products that existed, or that their accounts deactivated within 60 days without funding, costing both the customers and Chase's business."
      ],
      "description2": [
        "Partnering with product, marketing, finance, and engineering teams, I designed onboarding, driving SMB customers to adopt products that were valuable to them and led to higher revenue for Chase — driving product activation and increased fraud protection enrollment."
      ],
